  "headingOutline": [
    "H1: Modernising government with AI, data, and digital.",
    "H2: We deliver cutting-edge tools and services to UK government and public sector organisations, through all the m",
    "H2: User-centric digital services.",
    "H2: Enabling the public sector to do more with less.",
    "H2: Advancing public sector goals through digital, data, and AI.",
    "H2: Tech-enabled transformation in government.",
    "H3: Enabling AI-powered data management for BEIS, built to Government Digital Standards.",
    "H3: Building an AI & Automation roadmap for the UK Government's Insolvency Service.",
    "H3: Delivering enhanced AI intelligence at the Financial Conduct Authority.",
    "H3: Using AI search to identify risk at the Food Standards Agency.",
    "H2: Explore Aiimi solutions.",
    "H2: Talk to us about your data, AI, and digital transformation."
  ],
  "bodyText": "Modernising government with AI, data, and digital.\n\nDigital transformation enables better citizen experiences, stronger operational outcomes, and a more connected, mission-driven government.\n\nGet in touch\nWe deliver cutting-edge tools and services to UK government and public sector organisations, through all the major digital frameworks.\nUser-centric digital services.\n\nDigital expertise\n\nWe design and deliver digital products and services in compliance with GDS assessments, the Technology Code of Practice, NCSC guidance, and the latest accessibility standards.\n\nCloud and engineering.\n\nWe engineer and enable cloud data architecture, systems architecture, cloud-based document management, cloud migration, and legacy system migration through our AI platform.\n\nData and AI.\n\nWe create innovative products to transform data into value, and enable AI use cases through data science, data strategy and governance, data engineering, AI, and ML.\n\nKnowledge transfer.\n\nWe empower your people through skills transfer and capability development, with scaled support – from fully managed services to self-service and low-code/no-code products.\n\nEnabling the public sector to do more with less.\n\nStarting with Discovery, our end-to-end services establish clear, value-driven steps for Alpha, Beta, and Live, reducing overall costs, de-risking the project, aligning your people, and accelerating delivery.\n\n\"The data management system at BEIS lays the foundations for a great data service. It brings together tech to create a platform that not only supports our current needs but will change and grow to match our ever-evolving data journey.\"\n\nGavin Dollin, Product Sponsor and Head of Data Services\n\nAdvancing public sector goals through digital, data, and AI.\n01\n\nDeliver user-centred services through digital solutions that are Secure by Design.\n\n02\n\nDigitise manual processes to reduce costs and support digital transformation targets.\n\n03\n\nEnable efficient, joined-up services by reducing duplication and leveraging collective purchasing power.\n\n04\n\nImprove data access and governance, supporting cross-government tools and assessments.\n\n05\n\nModernise legacy systems in line with the CDDO’s IT Risk Assessment Framework.\n\nTech-enabled transformation in government.\nView all Case Studies\nEnabling AI-powered data management for BEIS, built to Government Digital Standards.\nView Case Study\nBuilding an AI & Automation roadmap for the UK Government's Insolvency Service.\nView Case Study\nDelivering enhanced AI intelligence at the Financial Conduct Authority.\nView Case Study\nUsing AI search to identify risk at the Food Standards Agency.\nView Case Study\nExplore Aiimi solutions.\nDigital Products\nAI Strategy & Roadmap\nAI Chat & Assistant\nLegacy System Migration\nData Strategy\nManaged Services\nTalk to us about your data, AI, and digital transformation.\n\nWe're here to help, whether you want a quick chat or a personalised demo from one of our experts. Just fill in the form and we'll be in touch within one working day.\n\nFirst Name*\nLast Name*\nEmail*\nPhone\nMessage\nHow did you first hear about us?\nPlease select\nSearch engine (e.g. Google, Bing)\nSocial media\nAI (ChatGPT, Copilot, Claude, etc)\nEvent or Webinar\nOnline advertisement\nNews or media article\nPodcast\nOfficial Aiimi Partner\nReview site (e.g. Gartner, G2)\nReferred by an Aiimi customer\nWord of mouth\nColleague or employer\nOther\nFrom time to time, we would like to contact you about our products, services, events and other content that we think will be of interest to you. You can unsubscribe from these communications at any time.\nYes please - I’d like to hear more from Aiimi!\nBy submitting this form you consent to us processing and storing the information you provide in accordance with our Privacy Policy\nSUBMIT"
}